add('figure-04',5,[102,82,583,1171],'Early current transient and transformed-time comparisons','One −800 mV transient plotted against time, square-root time and time to the three-halves power; inset shows the linear-region fit.','Specific current-transient analysis; exact identity with any Figure5 or Figure7 specimen is not established.',panels=['a: time','b: time^(1/2)','c: time^(3/2), with fit inset'],notes=['Body analyzes approximately 1.6–9.2 ms (transformed range 2–28 ms^(3/2)), not all 25 ms.','Inset slope 0.043315 and R=0.99947 are printed; body rounds R to0.999.','Model-derived N∞=2.32×10^10 cm−2 differs from the later NC-AFM density; do not silently reconcile.'])
