add('figure-05',6,[103,82,1094,1310],'Silver nanoparticle topography at four pulse durations','Four original NC-AFM images and line profiles with Ag deposition at −800 mV.','Panels a/b/c/d correspond to2/7/12/22 ms. Each image spans3 µm ×3 µm.',panels=['a:2 ms, Q=1.6 mC/cm² printed, Γ=0.007','b:7 ms, Q=3.6 mC/cm² printed, Γ=0.016','c:12 ms, Q=8.3 mC/cm² printed, Γ=0.037','d:22 ms, Q=18.7 mC/cm² printed, Γ=0.084'],notes=['Caption and text print mC/cm² here; Figure7/9 use µC/cm². Retain the source inconsistency instead of automatic conversion.','Γ values assume100% silver current efficiency and are upper bounds, not directly measured fractional monolayers.','Line profiles retain Å height units. Lateral image widths are tip-convolved and not reliable particle diameters.'])
add('figure-06',7,[103,82,582,1486],'Original TEM, measured SAED and source ring indexing','TEM of transferred nanoparticles, actual selected-area electron diffraction, and an explanatory indexed-ring drawing.','Particles mechanically removed from Si(100) following −800 mV deposition and transferred to carbon-coated gold TEM grids. Pulse duration, precise batch and Ag concentration of this specimen are unassigned.',evidence='experimental_tem_saed_and_source_schematic',panels=['a: experimental TEM,260 nm ×260 nm region','b: experimental SAED image with original beam stop','c: authors’ drawn FCC silver ring assignment'],notes=['Only b is a measured SAED pattern; c is a source schematic, never substituted for measured diffraction.','Body describes approximately100 particles with diameters10–25 Å in this TEM specimen; do not transfer that range to every NC-AFM formulation.','At least1 h air exposure precedes diffraction; this supports sample-scoped metallic-Ag persistence, not indefinite shelf stability.','No experimentally refined lattice coordinates or sample CIF are supplied.'])
add('figure-06b-saed',7,[124,520,561,952],'Measured selected-area electron diffraction','Standalone original Figure6b SAED panel, with beam stop and unmodified diffraction intensity.','Same transferred specimen as full Figure6; exact pulse duration and batch unassigned.',kind='figure_panel',evidence='experimental_saed',notes=['Parent Figure6 contains caption and panel-to-specimen context; show alongside or link it.','The extracted panel deliberately retains the original beam stop. No spots/rings were added, sharpened, removed or redrawn.','Related Figure6c is an author-drawn indexing diagram; Table1 lists the experimental and reference spacings.'])
add('table-01',7,[612,82,1094,352],'Measured and reference diffraction spacings','Table1 compares four experimental d spacings with the paper’s ICDD FCC silver reference values and relative intensities.','Measured values apply to the transferred nanoparticle diffraction specimen; expected values/intensities are external reference data.',kind='table',evidence='experimental_comparison_with_reference',notes=['hkl111/200/220/311: experimental2.37/2.04/1.42/1.22 Å; expected2.32/2.05/1.44/1.22 Å exactly as printed.','Expected intensities100/90/80/80% are reference values, not measured sample intensities.','The source cites ICDD03-0931; no local verified ICDD CIF is supplied or reconstructed.'])
add('figure-07',8,[102,82,582,655],'Four measured nanoparticle-height distributions','NC-AFM height histograms at increasing charge, with original mean and sigma labels.','Four plotted distributions. Caption lists5/10/15/25 ms from top to bottom at−800 mV.',panels=['top:Q2.8 µC/cm², mean2.2 nm, σ2.4 nm','second:Q7.8 µC/cm², mean7.5 nm, σ4.3 nm','third:Q17.6 µC/cm², mean13.5 nm, σ5.3 nm','bottom:Q38.1 µC/cm², mean17.1 nm, σ6.1 nm'],notes=['Caption says five samples although four histograms and four durations are present. Do not invent the fifth sample.','Body calls the smallest mean2.4 nm and spread2 nm; top histogram labels2.2 and2.4 nm. Preserve both scopes.','Heights are measured from five random3 µm ×3 µm images per sample. Approximate diameter equivalence is a shape-based interpretation, not a lateral AFM measurement.'])
add('figure-08',8,[612,82,1094,524],'Particle density versus pulse duration','Three day-grouped data series show particle areal density as pulse duration increases.','Fifteen depositions at−800 mV grouped into three preparation days; no physical batch IDs supplied.',notes=['Plot ordinate and body say particle density (µm−2); caption incorrectly says mean particle height and height-distribution sigma. Preserve this inconsistency.','Lines guide the eye; do not promote them to a measured continuous recipe-response predictor.','Values from plotted points are not digitized.','Body uses rates per millisecond, whereas Summary prints rates per second.'])
